                                "sense_id": "be545d6e-30ce-3ee2-9c52-100b4b5ba44e",
                                "text": "The advocates of humanity are not yet become too numerous: but those who practise its divine precepts, however humble and unnoticed be their station, ought not to sink into obscurity, unrecorded and unpraised, with the vile monsters who deride misery and fatten on calamity."
